# Analytics / GA4

Any script that opens our site (ryan-realty.com, localhost, 127.0.0.1, `*.vercel.app`) in a browser sets `rr_automation=1` and `rr_internal=1` before the first page load and never grants analytics consent; use `scripts/lib/marked-playwright.mjs`.
